@MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5298

### 1. Create a Vehicle (MaxLoadCapacity: 1500 kg)
POST {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licensePlate": "ND 123-456",
  "driverName": "Thabo",
  "maxLoadCapacity": 1500
}

### 2. Get All Vehicles
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Vehicles
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create a Delivery Ticket (Verify auto-generated DO-000001)
POST {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryAddress": "45 Nelson Mandela Dr, Ladysmith",
  "customerInfo": "Mica Hardware Site B",
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "status": 0
}

### 4. Get All Delivery Tickets
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create a Valid Ticket Item (10 x 50kg = 500kg / 1500kg)
POST {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/TicketItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemName": "50kg Cement Bags",
  "quantity": 10,
  "weightKg": 50.00,
  "deliveryTicketId": 1
}

### 6. Edge Case: Overweight Ticket Item (Should return 400 BadRequest)
POST {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/TicketItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemName": "50kg Cement Bags",
  "quantity": 25,
  "weightKg": 50.00,
  "deliveryTicketId": 1
}

### 7. Edge Case: Invalid Foreign Keys (Should return 400 BadRequest)
POST {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryAddress": "12 Main Rd, Durban",
  "customerInfo": "Invalid Vehicle Test",
  "vehicleId": 9999,
  "status": 0
}

### 8. Nested Lookup: Get Items for Ticket 1 (Should return 200 OK)
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets/1/items
Accept: application/json

### 9. Nested Lookup: Missing Ticket (Should return 404 NotFound)
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets/9999/items
Accept: application/json

### 10. Edge Case: Deliver Ticket WITHOUT POD (Should return 400 BadRequest)
PUT {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "deliveryAddress": "45 Nelson Mandela Dr, Ladysmith",
  "customerInfo": "Mica Hardware Site B",
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "status": 3
}

### 11. Create a POD Record for Ticket 1
POST {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/PodRecords
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proofOfDelivery": "Photo_001.jpg",
  "receivedBy": "Sipho Dlamini",
  "receivedSignature": "S.Dlamini",
  "notes": "Left at main gate",
  "deliveryTicketId": 3
}

### 12. Nested Lookup: Get POD for Ticket 1 (Should return 200 OK)
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets/1/pod
Accept: application/json

### 13. Deliver Ticket WITH POD (Should return 204 NoContent)
PUT {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "deliveryAddress": "45 Nelson Mandela Dr, Ladysmith",
  "customerInfo": "Mica Hardware Site B",
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "status": 3
}

### 14. Edge Case: Modify Already-Delivered Ticket (Should return 400 BadRequest)
PUT {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "deliveryAddress": "Updated Address After Delivery",
  "customerInfo": "Mica Hardware Site B",
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "status": 3
}

### 15. Filter Delivery Tickets by Status (0 = Created, 3 = Delivered)
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets?status=3
Accept: application/json

### 16. Filter Delivery Tickets by VehicleId
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets?vehicleId=1
Accept: application/json

### 17. Search Delivery Tickets by Address, Customer, or Order Number
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets?search=Ladysmith
Accept: application/json

### 18. Combined Filter: Vehicle + Status + Descending Order Check
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets?vehicleId=1&status=0
Accept: application/json

### 19. Filter with No Matches (Should return 200 OK with empty array [])
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets?search=NonExistentSite999
Accept: application/json

### 20. Get Vehicle Manifest & Load Summary (Valid Vehicle)
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Vehicles/1/manifest
Accept: application/json

### 21. Get Vehicle Manifest for Non-Existent Vehicle (Should return 404 Not Found)
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Vehicles/999/manifest
Accept: application/json

### 22. Verify ProblemDetails on Invalid Route (Should return 404 application/problem+json)
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/NonExistentRoute
Accept: application/json

### 23. Verify ProblemDetails on Invalid Query Enum (Should return 400 application/problem+json)
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/DeliveryTickets?status=InvalidStatus
Accept: application/json

### 24. Verify CORS Headers for Allowed Frontend Origin (Should include Access-Control-Allow-Origin)
GET {{MicaDispatch.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Vehicles
Origin: http://localhost:8081
Accept: application/json